# Customer working folders - inventories and mapping CSVs contain personal data.
# Keep all customer material local; see customers/README.md.
customers/*
!customers/README.md

# Script output
output/
Inventory-*/
Inventory_*/
TestResults*

# Data exports and secrets-bearing artifacts
*.csv
!01-Design/templates/*.csv
!tests/fixtures/**/*.csv
*.log
*.ppkg
*.pfx
*.xlsx

# Defence in depth: report/export artifacts must never be tracked even if a
# script is pointed at a repo path by mistake (see Assert-CustomerDataPath)
Review.md
Readiness.md
TrustedLocations-for-target.*
TrustedLocations-README.md
TeamsExportCoverage.*
*.pdf
summary.json
!tests/fixtures/**/summary.json
